-13T10:14:59Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e68bb8d2598b97967786a104edacc869b13ee57", "message": "Fix .desktop files for wayland\n\nTBB apears as firefox in wayland mode (gnome)", "created_at": "2021-07-20T15:33:46Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4142c3b6a54ee760d095d410055f06ab88f9987b", "message": "Backporting\n\n - Unify 0.9.52 and 0.9.58 README.md\n - 0.9.52 README.md\n   - You should not have a user writeable systemwide configuration file\n     at all. No need to explicit state this here. Also for .locals it is\n     low risk IMHO.\n   - IDC about firetools. Anyway the info is wrong, .desktop files\n     aren't shell scripts, they don't have variable/command/...\n     substitution. If you try to add $HOME in a path, your issue.\n - 0.9.52: We should not ship locals at all. Maybe template if they are\n   explicit marked as template. Even adding ths ftb-x11 include to\n   ftb.local is bad and should be changed once we have a better solution\n   (preprocessed profiles)\n - Remove kcmp from seccomp.drop.\n - Backport other chagnes to 0.9.62 and 0.9.64.4", "created_at": "2021-07-20T15:24:12Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "51d10b5cc50bcdcbb09a2f1d6ba54b6ec5c4f632", "message": "Rework install.sh and update.sh\n\n - Rename firejailed-tor-browser.desktop to firejailed-tor-browser.desktop.in\n - Create firejailed-tor-browser-x11.inc\n - Add option --x11\n - Add autodetection for --x11\n - Move common code into _common.sh\n - (hopefully) simplify the code\n - Make the code more robust\n - Use [[ instead of [\n - Set -o pipefail", "created_at": "2021-07-19T16:44:29Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "03deae79bea0440b42accb8e773baeedc7aadfd8", "message": "Make ${HOME} and /tmp read-only", "created_at": "2021-07-07T18:49:49Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "76c4226bbc60648802e02168010d2698dabdf47d", "message": "Enable Wayland; Block X11", "created_at": "2021-07-07T18:48:02Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6144ed63da0e8e9ec2910ba20a4012d7e1b428f2", "message": "Fix ./clean.sh --help: exit 0", "created_at": "2021-07-07T18:44:34Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "02c3ff5da0105202165b3d33b944529309734c06", "message": "Backport for 0.9.64.4", "created_at": "2021-06-05T06:56:26Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dde4633325636f8bc520b8b2d0aea1096135c409", "message": "Harden firejailed-tor-browser.profile (noinput) \u2026\n\nand remove useless lines.", "created_at": "2021-06-05T06:51:57Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3540eebc142ca5938e69ca9708fe6a4100087814", "message": "Harden & Fix firejailed-tor-browser.profile", "created_at": "2021-05-19T17:12:55Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "543b23cbd3c3db1bc6651adaab001569c1a8b053", "message": "Harden firejailed-tor-browser.profile", "created_at": "2021-03-23T17:13:51Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d6c911d7a08587d0ac9347c66255e23dad30af81", "message": "Improve code-quality in update.sh & install.sh", "created_at": "2021-03-23T17:13:18Z", "repo": "firejailed-tor-browser", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "347cba24a355e29088e36fc36c0c3c4f6c4576b5", "message": "upd